OL,3,GNEWSANext stage unveiled in landmark
OL,4,Arestoration plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next step in a five-year plan to
OL,7,Frevamp iconic monuments in Hull has
OL,8,Fbeen announced.
OL,10,FThe King William III (King Billy)
OL,11,Fstatue and the fountains on Park Avenue
OL,12,Fand Westbourne Avenue are to undergo
OL,13,Frestoration after assessments found
OL,14,Ftheir condition had deteriorated.
OL,16,FHull City Council has appointed
OL,17,Fheritage and conservation architect
OL,18,FPick Everard to help deliver the
OL,19,Fscheme.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
