OL,3,GNEWSANext stage unveiled in landmark
OL,4,Arestoration plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Ieronimo, cabinet
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for transport and
OL,8,Finfrastructure at the council, said:
OL,9,F"King Billy and the Avenues fountains
OL,10,Fare among Hull's most recognisable,
OL,11,Fhistorical landmarks and we are
OL,12,Fcommitted to preserving them."
